I ruling&nbsp;I got (form Dave) was you can not react to a reaction.

In the game every player get a reaction, it refreshed&nbsp;at the start of their&nbsp;turn.

&nbsp;

So in turn 1 you go first, it does not refesh&nbsp;until you go next, even if you are the last person in turn 2.

